{
    desc => q{Visual toggle case ~},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
Action: v selects chars, ~ toggles case

-1_initial.png (initial state):
- Cursor at line 1, col 0

Sub-commands: keys('v4l~')

-2_after.png (after action):
- First 5 chars uppercased: `HELLO world this is a test`
- Line 1: `HELLO world this is a test`
- Cursor at end of toggled region
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('v4l~');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('after');
    },
}
